==Battleground==
*3 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Clyde Gory|Clyde Gories]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Money is very abundant here, so even expensive Cats countering the [[Red Enemies|Red]] or [[Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies can be used, as well as fast/tanky units to burst down the Master A. like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]

